# Claude Code
.claude/

# graphify - keep portable graph data, ignore machine-local + regenerable
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
# graphify graph living inside the jobcard-system project
jobcard-system/graphify-out/*
!jobcard-system/graphify-out/graph.json
!jobcard-system/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
